{"title":"뱀 가문의 막내딸입니다 [단행본]","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=dXbG0/dJMb99U5Kiu/tNx74wWViGhYcTF5XEkQj1&filename=th3","synopsis":"예정일이 한참 지난 알이 부화했다.\n\n\"삐이!\"\n\n새하얀 솜뭉치가 빼꼼 고개를 내밀며 주변을 살폈다.\n그것이 태어나는 순간을 지켜보던 남자는 침묵했다.\n자신은 뱀(그것도 블랙맘바)이건만, 태어난 건 아기 새였다.\n\n* * *\n\n잠깐 정신을 잃고 눈을 떴더니 아기 새가 되어있었다.\n그리고 그것도 모자라서,\n\n\"감히 누가 내 딸을 울렸지? 당장 그 목을 비틀어주지.\"\n\"뚝. 말 하지 않아도 된단다. 한 놈도 남김없이 쓸어주마. 그 중에 한 명은 있겠지.\"\n\"둘 다 진정해요. 내 동생은 비위가 약하니 뒤에서 처리하도록 하죠.\"\n\n다들 보호가 너무 과해!\n마랭 장편 로맨스판타지 소설 <뱀 가문의 막내딸입니다>","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-09-25","rank":232,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-26","rank":153,"change":{"type":"up","amount":79}},{"date":"2026-09-27","rank":145,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-09-28","rank":213,"change":{"type":"down","amount":68}},{"date":"2026-09-29","rank":256,"change":{"type":"down","amount":43}},{"date":"2026-10-01","rank":178,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-10-02","rank":242,"change":{"type":"down","amount":64}},{"date":"2026-10-08","rank":216,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}}],"weekly":[{"date":"2026-09-26","rank":269,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-27","rank":196,"change":{"type":"up","amount":73}},{"date":"2026-09-28","rank":177,"change":{"type":"up","amount":19}},{"date":"2026-09-29","rank":173,"change":{"type":"up","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-09-30","rank":166,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-10-01","rank":159,"change":{"type":"up","amount":7}},{"date":"2026-10-02","rank":158,"change":{"type":"up","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-10-03","rank":186,"change":{"type":"down","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-10-04","rank":241,"change":{"type":"down","amount":55}},{"date":"2026-10-05","rank":281,"change":{"type":"down","amount":40}}],"monthly":[]},"viewSeries":[],"metricsSeries":[{"date":"2026-10-07","v":3969,"rc":3,"rs":26,"cc":0},{"date":"2026-10-08","v":4144,"rc":3,"rs":26,"cc":0},{